  "description": "APP Kirrane Auctioneering are delighted to offer for sale this splendid two bedroom modern apartment located in The Old Bond Store, built in the 1800's to store liquor, that came into Ballina Port until the Duty was paid on it.  The Bond Store has a beautiful cobble stone courtyard with Dillons Restaurant and Billy's Restaurant on the ground floor, apartments overhead and a few town houses.  Its hidden away just off Dillon Terrace close to where you cross over the Moy River on the Lower bridge.\n\nThe two bedroom apartment is finished to the highest of standards and will make a lovely home or investment property for its new owner.  Currently  being used as an AirBnB  it attracts families looking for affordable accommodation for 1-2 weeks at a time to be close to Ballina or Enniscrone.  It would make a great long term rental property as well offering a high yield on investment.\n\nThe apartment comes with one parking space in a secure car park to the rear of The Bond Store Building.  The complex is managed through The Bond Store Management Company Limited by Guarantee.  This is not a regular apartment in a huge apartment block.  This is a private apartment on the first floor with balcony and the benefit of two restaurants at your feet.  \n\nSeldom does an apartment come available in this boutique complex, walking distance to all Ballina's amenities.  This one won't be here long,\n call us today to book a viewing.  Viewings are available through the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering where we don't just list properties we sell them. \n\nPlease Note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy